"This module extends the CRM BANT Qualification page by adding a\n"
"Marketing section directly on the same notebook page. It displays the\n"
"campaign, medium, source, and referral fields alongside the BANT\n"
"qualification data, giving sales teams full marketing attribution\n"
"context in one place.\n"
